WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:40.230 --> 00:01:42.740
I'll have apricots...

00:01:50.050 --> 00:01:53.980
Oh my gosh! This is Paris, the city of flowers!

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:56.560
Nice to see you here.

00:01:56.960 --> 00:01:59.060
P-Phan!

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:02.310
The apostle of souls who forever wander!

00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:03.900
That's me.

00:02:03.900 --> 00:02:06.830
I'm happy to see you remember me.

00:02:11.740 --> 00:02:13.360
My name is Blood.

00:02:13.720 --> 00:02:17.190
Apostle of darkness, wandering in search of blood.

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:21.970
My name is Howly. Apostle of
the beast, howling at the moon.

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:26.620
I'm Cadav. Apostle of the undead, cursing fate itself.

00:02:27.220 --> 00:02:29.880
What are you after?!

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:33.930
We will destroy the World Tournament.

00:02:33.930 --> 00:02:36.440
That is the mission of team Shadows.

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:38.900
Destroy the World Tournament?!

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:45.440
You will be the first to fall prey to our Sacred Beasts!

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:26.400
That dream again..?

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:31.960
Guess I won't be sleeping tonight.

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:38.160
I hope we can contact President
Daitenji soon and get to Russia safely.

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:46.140
What will happen if the powerful Bladers of Team Shadows attack us again..?

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:16.480
I can feel the presence of Sacred Beasts...

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:19.130
Those of which we must annihilate.

00:04:19.870 --> 00:04:21.910
That is our mission.

00:04:32.670 --> 00:04:37.680
The Corps of the Black Shadows.

00:04:44.270 --> 00:04:47.080
Wow, I really like this boulevard!

00:04:47.630 --> 00:04:52.080
This is <i>Champs-Élysées</i>. It's French for 'Elysian Fields'.

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:53.830
Is that so?

00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:57.870
They're Bey battling in here!

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:00.880
It really is Beyblade!

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:04.380
Looks like Beyblade is popular here, too.

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:06.080
<i>Wow!</i>

00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:18.110
Europe seems to have taken a habit to Beyblading.

00:05:18.110 --> 00:05:21.920
Yeah, Beyblade has always been popular here.

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:25.830
I found many powerful opponents here when I was training.

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:30.840
And yet Europe's top team
isn't participating in the Tournament...

00:05:30.840 --> 00:05:32.440
That's surely something to think about.

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:37.070
That restaurant looks delicious!

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:40.310
No matter where you are,
Takao, you only think about food.

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:42.670
He's a glutton, no matter how you see it.

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:45.100
Still, I can't say I'm not interested.

00:05:45.100 --> 00:05:48.840
Right now, our sole priority is to seek out Kai.

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:51.750
I know, I know. Who do you take me for?

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:56.270
What was he thinking, sneaking out of the hotel? What if something bad happens?

00:05:56.270 --> 00:06:01.490
I'm sure Kai can take care of himself.
We have Team Shadows to worry about.

00:06:01.490 --> 00:06:05.140
We should stick together in case they show.

00:06:05.140 --> 00:06:10.720
Indeed. Staying in the hotel and waiting
for the President to call would be our best bet.

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:12.790
Let's find Kai and—

00:06:12.790 --> 00:06:15.840
Reminds me of our search all over Hong Kong!

00:06:15.840 --> 00:06:19.120
Back then, he helped us when we needed it most.

00:06:19.570 --> 00:06:21.600
Everything looks yummy...

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:26.890
Holy cow, what a huge gate! Whose house is <i>that</i>?!

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:32.640
Man, it really is huge!

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:34.170
Takao!

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:47.370
Professor?

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:50.460
No, no, it's nothing.

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:54.590
So big...

00:06:54.590 --> 00:07:00.080
It's the <i>Arc de Triomphe</i>. It was built by Napoleon's request and completed in 1836.

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:05.100
<i>Wonderful!</i> Something this big
was built so long ago? Amazing.

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:08.040
It's just a gate, you know. There's no house.

00:07:08.330 --> 00:07:11.830
It and the Eiffel Tower are symbols of Paris.

00:07:11.830 --> 00:07:14.790
Eiffel Tower..? That gives me a great idea!

00:07:14.790 --> 00:07:17.500
Your 'great ideas' aren't always that great.

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:19.040
Now listen, will ya?

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:22.800
We're looking for Kai, and the Tower is very tall.

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:29.080
What I'm getting at is that if we look down on
the city from up there, we'll be able to find Kai!

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:32.060
Right? Let's go!

00:07:33.110 --> 00:07:36.360
What if Kai is in a building..?

00:07:36.710 --> 00:07:41.040
Nothing we can do now. Once Takao sets
his mind to something, he follows through.

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:42.800
You're right. Let's go.

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:50.620
So high!

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:52.790
We can see the whole city from here.

00:07:52.790 --> 00:07:56.120
See? This'll make finding Kai easy!

00:07:56.320 --> 00:07:59.380
Just how good is your sight, Takao?

00:08:02.910 --> 00:08:05.440
You can see well! Look! Look!

00:08:10.280 --> 00:08:14.420
Professor, we'll be looking
from this floor's viewing platform.

00:08:14.420 --> 00:08:17.000
Kai might be up here.

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:19.520
You guys go look on a higher floor.

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:21.690
Will do.

00:08:28.100 --> 00:08:31.980
Now that's what I call a view! Feels great!

00:08:31.980 --> 00:08:38.860
The Eiffel Tower was built for Paris' very own <i>Exposition Universelle</i> in 1889.

00:08:38.860 --> 00:08:41.280
It was designed by Gustave Eiffel.

00:08:41.280 --> 00:08:46.320
Oh? The designer has the same name as the tower! What a coincidence.

00:08:48.240 --> 00:08:52.780
It's 300 meters tall—only
slightly shorter than the Tokyo Tower.

00:08:59.940 --> 00:09:01.780
You can see everything from here!

00:09:01.780 --> 00:09:04.560
We're going to find Kai in a jiffy!

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:07.010
Professor, what's that building?

00:09:07.930 --> 00:09:12.320
The <i>Tour Montparnasse</i>, a 209-meter-tall skyscraper.

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:14.240
Oh?

00:09:14.520 --> 00:09:16.980
Hey, weren't we looking for Kai?

00:09:16.980 --> 00:09:19.140
I <i>am</i> looking!

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:22.420
Oh! That's the gate we saw before! What is it?

00:09:22.770 --> 00:09:28.470
That's <i>La Madeleine</i>. Like the <i>Arc de Triomphe</i>, its construction was ordered by Napoleon.

00:09:28.600 --> 00:09:30.210
Oh... And over here?

00:09:30.550 --> 00:09:34.800
<i>Les Invalides</i>.
A domed chapel built under Louis XIV's reign.

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:37.080
Then what about that?

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:41.280
<i>Musée d'Orsay</i>. Right beyond that is the Louvre!

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:46.080
A countless number of invaluable paintings and other works of art are stored inside.

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:50.050
Actually, if we have some time later, I'd love to go.

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:54.160
A city filled with history and art...

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:57.380
It's not called the 'City of Flowers' for nothing!

00:09:57.380 --> 00:10:01.970
But that's not all! There are also
many facilities fit for Beyblade...

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:04.930
Professor... What's <i>that</i>?

00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:11.070
Oh! That's Cadav. Member of the Team Shadows and apostle of the undead, cursing fate itself.

00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:14.010
Yeah, thought so...

00:10:16.400 --> 00:10:18.500
Found you..!

00:10:35.520 --> 00:10:36.500
Takao!

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:37.350
Professor!

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:40.680
Let's go!

00:10:40.680 --> 00:10:41.590
Yeah.

00:10:42.190 --> 00:10:44.460
It's here!

00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:45.210
Huh?

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:50.620
He disappeared.

00:10:53.450 --> 00:10:54.940
Where did he go?

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:59.230
Who are you looking for?

00:11:02.730 --> 00:11:05.250
I will defeat your Sacred Beasts.

00:11:08.920 --> 00:11:10.120
We will destroy...

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:11.620
The Sacred Beats...

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:13.120
We despise...

00:11:13.370 --> 00:11:17.380
Why? Why are you trying to destroy the Sacred Beats?!

00:11:20.440 --> 00:11:21.440
Takao!

00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:22.130
Professor!

00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:25.150
You again!

00:11:25.150 --> 00:11:26.050
Team Shadow!

00:11:32.180 --> 00:11:33.870
Four against three...

00:11:33.870 --> 00:11:35.740
This doesn't bode well for us.

00:11:35.740 --> 00:11:38.300
Kai! Where on Earth are you?!

00:11:57.850 --> 00:11:59.610
Looking good.

00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:05.860
Our goal is to destroy the Sacred Beasts.

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:09.210
As well as our mission.

00:12:09.210 --> 00:12:11.430
Why? Why are you doing this?!

00:12:11.430 --> 00:12:13.760
What do you have against the Sacred Beasts?!

00:12:14.280 --> 00:12:15.660
Against?

00:12:17.110 --> 00:12:20.140
Destroying them is not enough.

00:12:20.680 --> 00:12:23.130
Since you insist, let me explain.

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:27.200
Our objective is to win, and we hate losing.

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:34.000
A fixation on victory is our Blader way of life.

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:35.240
So what?!

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:44.140
Whilst qualifying for the World Tornament,
we were destroyed by those harnessing Sacred Beasts.

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:53.540
This is boring.

00:12:53.940 --> 00:12:56.670
I... I lost?!

00:12:56.880 --> 00:13:02.420
I have never been so humiliated in my life! Curse you, Sacred Beasts!

00:13:11.960 --> 00:13:13.290
Maybe next time.

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:19.080
I lost! How could this happen?!

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:20.780
You're weak.

00:13:20.780 --> 00:13:24.740
No! I lost to your Sacred Beast!

00:13:25.050 --> 00:13:29.120
It's not a difference in power... It's because of your Sacred Beast!

00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:38.600
This was a waste of time.

00:13:39.300 --> 00:13:41.350
I... I can't take this!

00:13:49.440 --> 00:13:51.960
You're weak. Far too weak!

00:13:51.960 --> 00:13:54.430
You can't even use a Sacred Beast?

00:13:54.430 --> 00:13:57.400
And you still tried to fight? Not in a million years.

00:13:58.090 --> 00:14:00.700
I-I will never forgive the Sacred Beasts...

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:03.010
That humiliation...

00:14:03.010 --> 00:14:05.750
I despise them! I need power!

00:14:05.750 --> 00:14:09.120
If I had more power, I wouldn't have lost!

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:16.140
I'll take anything! Any kind
of power is fine! So give it to me!

00:14:16.140 --> 00:14:19.380
The power to defeat the Sacred Beasts we despise..!

00:14:20.360 --> 00:14:23.140
I will grant your wishes...

00:14:23.140 --> 00:14:25.700
but only in exchange for your souls.

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:46.650
We were granted supernatural
powers by a transcendent being.

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:50.680
And so Team Shadows came to be.

00:14:50.680 --> 00:14:52.680
We despise the Sacred Beasts!

00:14:52.960 --> 00:14:55.160
What does that have to do with us?!

00:14:55.360 --> 00:14:59.430
We only exist to destroy all Sacred Beasts!

00:14:59.430 --> 00:15:00.810
What was that?!

00:15:01.280 --> 00:15:04.760
We will destroy each and every Sacred Beast in the world.

00:15:05.230 --> 00:15:06.920
You're just looking for excuses!

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:10.740
By destroying the Sacred
Beasts, we will be granted salvation!

00:15:10.740 --> 00:15:12.010
Go, Wulfos!

00:15:12.320 --> 00:15:13.200
Blaggens!

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:14.070
Dracuos!

00:15:14.440 --> 00:15:15.790
Undeos!

00:15:16.370 --> 00:15:18.350
As if I'd lose to you!

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:19.260
Let's do it!

00:15:19.260 --> 00:15:19.870
<i>Okay!</i>

00:15:44.770 --> 00:15:49.130
As always, the quality of
Hiwatari Industries' products is top-notch.

00:15:49.290 --> 00:15:51.880
The new Dranzer Flame...

00:15:52.270 --> 00:15:55.500
Both power and defense have greatly improved.

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:58.800
Sneaking out of the hotel for this was totally worth it.

00:16:00.920 --> 00:16:02.320
That's..!

00:16:03.660 --> 00:16:05.740
That's the light that comes from Sacred Beasts!

00:16:05.740 --> 00:16:07.260
Them again..!

00:16:22.150 --> 00:16:23.150
Destroy!

00:16:23.150 --> 00:16:24.230
The Sacred Beasts!

00:16:24.230 --> 00:16:25.610
Crush them!

00:16:26.030 --> 00:16:27.690
And win!

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:30.390
The obsession with winning...

00:16:30.390 --> 00:16:33.950
We don't share your fixation for victory!

00:16:33.950 --> 00:16:39.110
Sure, we wish to win, but
having a good fight is our priority!

00:16:39.110 --> 00:16:40.190
We don't...

00:16:42.160 --> 00:16:43.930
So powerful!

00:16:49.340 --> 00:16:50.290
This is bad!

00:16:51.630 --> 00:16:53.000
<i>No!</i> Draciel!

00:16:54.020 --> 00:16:55.200
Is this the end?

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:57.310
Don't give up!

00:16:57.310 --> 00:16:58.750
Easy for you to say..!

00:17:03.440 --> 00:17:05.440
What can we do?!

00:17:05.860 --> 00:17:08.640
I thought not giving up was your way of life!

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:14.360
Kai!

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:17.610
Where the heck were you? You're late, man!

00:17:17.990 --> 00:17:20.000
Here comes their comrade.

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:23.850
Well, no matter. You'll be our first victim!

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:25.400
Do you have what it takes?

00:17:26.970 --> 00:17:28.820
That's a new Dranzer!

00:17:29.070 --> 00:17:31.340
Any last wishes?

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:34.300
Fool! Go, Wulfos!

00:17:42.850 --> 00:17:44.500
Go, Dranzer Flame!

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:51.820
Incredible!

00:17:52.180 --> 00:17:54.600
Perish, evil creatures!

00:18:02.440 --> 00:18:04.250
How can this be?!

00:18:04.250 --> 00:18:06.400
Our dark power..!

00:18:07.180 --> 00:18:10.040
We... We lost again..?!

00:18:10.930 --> 00:18:13.940
No! I don't want to lose again!

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:16.070
We have to win!

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:16.960
We'll take you down!

00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:25.110
We're jumping in, too!

00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:56.480
This is the end for you!

00:19:11.240 --> 00:19:12.720
Alright!

00:19:12.720 --> 00:19:15.340
Victory is ours!

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:18.480
Your loss, then.

00:19:18.790 --> 00:19:21.000
We will defeat the Sacred Beasts.

00:19:23.060 --> 00:19:25.160
We will not give up.

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:28.890
We will come back.

00:19:30.930 --> 00:19:32.980
To fight you.

00:19:40.070 --> 00:19:42.210
You saved us, Kai!

00:19:42.210 --> 00:19:45.080
I just wanted to try out my new Dranzer.

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:47.160
I knew you'd say that.

00:19:48.460 --> 00:19:50.850
You're not bad at all.

00:20:01.670 --> 00:20:07.410
Here I was, ready to interfere,
but I guess it wasn't necessary.

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:12.200
Don't misunderstand, though.

00:20:12.200 --> 00:20:19.420
I don't care what happens to you. I just
didn't want them to damage to the Eiffel tower.

00:20:19.420 --> 00:20:23.410
You're a Beyblader too?! Are you one of them?!

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:27.420
Please don't lump me together with those un-artistic brutes.

00:20:27.420 --> 00:20:29.470
I had a matter to settle with them.

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:30.540
What matter?

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:33.460
Nothing that should concern you.

00:20:33.720 --> 00:20:37.160
I've forgotten to introduce myself. My apologies.

00:20:37.160 --> 00:20:40.470
I am Olivier. Olivier Boulanger.

00:20:40.470 --> 00:20:42.150
Olivier..?

00:20:42.460 --> 00:20:47.150
Your fight was quite gallant
and brimming with <i>fighting spirit</i>.

00:20:47.150 --> 00:20:48.640
R-Right...

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:50.890
But it wasn't pretty.

00:20:50.890 --> 00:20:57.190
Bey battles should be artistic. You should
control your Sacred Beasts more gracefully.

00:20:57.190 --> 00:20:59.920
You're nowhere near doing so.

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:04.670
Hey, come back! What do you know about us?!

00:21:05.500 --> 00:21:08.500
I've said too much.
Pay me no mind.

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.500
Well, have a good one!

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:13.440
Who <i>is </i>that guy..?

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:23.190
Looks like getting to Russia safe will prove to be difficult.

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:57.630 --> 00:23:02.860
According to my analysis, that Olivier boy is no ordinary person!

00:23:02.860 --> 00:23:08.340
How could it be? He's a genius chef, working as a vice-head chef at a first-class French restaurant!

00:23:08.800 --> 00:23:17.310
And that's not all! He's also France's strongest Blader, and the owner of the Sacred Beast Unicolyon!

00:23:17.310 --> 00:23:20.360
Next time: The Elegant Sacred Beast User!

00:23:20.360 --> 00:23:24.380
The way he fights is certainly <i>très bien</i>!
